  (text "LM2596 / 5,0 V" (at 320 241 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c69b82ab-9484-483c-b96b-efb5ba339905"))
  (text "Điều chỉnh và đo đầu ra 5,0 V trước khi kết nối tải." (at 253 246 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c55d3e0-b85b-4fe4-bc12-2895f6ac2341"))
  (text "Never connect LM2596 5 V output to 3V3.\nTwo PWR_FLAGs: ERC declarations only; no hardware, BOM or PCB.\nPA4: GPIO output push-pull, initial High; CS active Low.\nVERIFY U1.8 SDX / U1.9 SCX are auxiliary ASDx / ASCx on V1.3;\nbefore simultaneous USB connection.\nno hardware flow control. PA9 TX -> RX; PA10 RX <- TX.\nU1 INT1 / INT2 / SDX / SCX: NC; PA0 unused (poll SPI).\nPWM frequency, pulse range and calibration: match actual ESC.\nSelect SPI and initialize BMI270 per datasheet / Bosch SensorAPI.\nLiPo 3S: nominal 11.1 V; fully charged 12.6 V.\nTIM4 default, no remap: B6 / B7 / B8 / B9 = ESC1 / 2 / 3 / 4.\nNever connect LiPo to STM32 5V, 3V3 or backup VBAT.\nVerify BMI270 V1.3 module supports a 3.3 V supply.\nVerify DevKit accepts power at 5V and LM2596 has enough current." (at 15 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "029da8eb-b7cf-4b7a-aa12-5737366d90b4"))
  (text "Software NSS; SPI1 clock 72 MHz / 32 = SCK 2.25 MHz.\nUSART1: CRSF, 420000 baud, 8N1, non-inverted, full duplex;\nPA13/PA14 reserved for SWD; set existing BOOT0 jumper = 0.\nMaster, full duplex, 8-bit, MSB first; Mode 0: CPOL=0, CPHA=0.\nConfiguration notes only: firmware has NOT been created or flashed.\n400 Hz and DShot support are NOT assumed.\nAll four ESC pin 7 BEC/VCC: NC. No BEC or USB logic supply.\nCrossings connect only where a junction dot is shown.\nAdjust AND measure LM2596 output = 5.0 V before connecting loads.\nU7: logical module symbol; physical pin numbers / footprint UNVERIFIED.\ndo not confuse these with Bosch chip primary SDx / SCx.\nUSB is NOT the supply; verify DevKit backfeed protection\nMotor numbers do not define rotation or mixer." (at 128 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1a76df5a-0a74-4c6c-abc5-7ccb451df3b8"))
  (text "U7: số chân logic / chân vật lý / footprint CHƯA XÁC MINH." (at 253 249.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85)) (justify left top)) (uuid "148b310e-5c1e-4975-b125-2cf5a0724890"))
